<task id="121" project="unified-access-control-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Rename the canonical secure business unit and its owner role — Secure Project → Secure Record — as ONE coordinated change, with the operator step the code cannot perform</title>
    <phase>Register-driven (authored 2026-09-29, session 25; D-12 item 6, owner-approved)</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .cs on the external-access provisioning path and changes a FAIL-CLOSED lookup key. Tags include auth. A partial change stops provisioning.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>The name is a fail-closed lookup key spanning code, config, tests, docs and a live Dataverse artifact, and the string "Secure Project" has FOUR distinct meanings in this repo — a blind find-replace silently breaks the external SPA's product name and falsifies dated historical records.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Touches Api/ExternalAccess/** (parallel-unsafe in this project) plus shared test fixtures used by three integration suites.</parallel-reason>
